      "q": "How much does Maximus Federal Services make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Maximus Federal Services obligated $430M in FY2026 to date. Maximus Federal Services won 47 awards in the fiscal year to date, with an average award size of $9.1M, and obligations fell 71.0% year over year. Prior fiscal-year obligations were $1.4B in FY21, $1.1B in FY22, $1.1B in FY23, $1.1B in FY24, and $1.5B in FY25."
